{% doc %}
  @prompt
    IMPORTANT:
    - Do NOT include the human/person shown in the reference image.
    - The section should be designed specifically for a plant nursery / plant e-commerce website.
    - All plant/product images must be selectable through Shopify's Theme Editor using image upload/picker options.
    - Do NOT hardcode image URLs.
    - Make the section fully responsive for desktop, tablet and mobile.
    
    SECTION LAYOUT:
    
    1. MAIN SECTION
    - Full-width horizontal section.
    - Use a soft warm cream/off-white background.
    - Add a subtle decorative abstract radial/sunburst shape in the background on the right side.
    - Keep the overall design clean, premium and modern.
    - Rounded corners where appropriate.
    
    2. PRODUCT CAROUSEL
    Create a horizontally scrollable product carousel on the left/middle area.
    
    Display 3 plant product cards at a time on desktop.
    
    Each product card should contain:
    
    TOP AREA:
    - Large product image.
    - Image must be selectable/uploadable from Shopify Theme Editor.
    - Image should automatically fit inside the image area without distortion.
    - Rounded top corners.
    - Bestseller badge at top-left.
    - Discount badge at top-right.
    
    PRODUCT DETAILS:
    - Small rating badge such as:
      ★ 4.8 | 440
    - Product title.
    - Short product description.
    - Current price.
    - Original price with strikethrough.
    - Discount percentage.
    - Circular dark-green Add to Cart icon/button at bottom-right.
    
    Example content:
    Product 1:
    Title: Peace Lily Plant
    Description: Stunning air-purifying plant
    Price: ₹299
    Original Price: ₹350
    Discount: 15% OFF
    Rating: 4.8
    Reviews: 440
    
    Product 2:
    Title: Anthurium Red Plant
    Description: Long-lasting indoor plant
    Price: ₹699
    Original Price: ₹800
    Discount: 13% OFF
    Rating: 4.8
    Reviews: 111
    
    Product 3:
    Title: Jade Mini Plant
    Description: Easy-care lucky succulent
    Price: ₹249
    Original Price: ₹300
    Discount: 17% OFF
    Rating: 4.8
    Reviews: 414
    
    3. SHOPIFY CUSTOMIZATION OPTIONS
    
    In the Shopify Theme Editor, provide settings for each product card:
    
    - Product image upload/picker
    - Product title
    - Product description
    - Current price
    - Original price
    - Discount text
    - Bestseller badge ON/OFF
    - Bestseller text
    - Rating
    - Review count
    - Product link
    - Add to cart button
    - Card background color
    
    Allow at least 6 product cards to be added dynamically using Shopify blocks.
    
    Each block should have its own image picker.
    
    4. CAROUSEL FUNCTIONALITY
    
    - Desktop: show 3 cards.
    - Tablet: show 2 cards.
    - Mobile: show 1 card with part of the next card visible.
    - Add a circular dark-green right arrow button overlapping the carousel.
    - Add a left arrow as well, but keep it subtle.
    - Smooth horizontal sliding animation.
    - Touch/swipe support on mobile.
    - Do not use external carousel libraries.
    - Use lightweight JavaScript/CSS.
    - Infinite or smooth looping is preferred.
    - Disable arrows when there are no more slides if infinite looping is not used.
    
    5. DESIGN STYLE
    
    Use a premium nursery / botanical visual style.
    
    Colors:
    - Dark green: #1F5130
    - Yellow/golden accent: #FFD60A
    - Cream background: #FFF9E8
    - White product card: #FFFFFF
    - Muted gray for secondary text.
    
    Typography:
    - Product titles should have a slightly elegant serif style.
    - Descriptions and prices should use a clean modern sans-serif font.
    - Use responsive font sizes.
    
    6. IMAGE SETTINGS
    
    VERY IMPORTANT:
    Every product card must have a Shopify image picker.
    
    Example schema structure:
    
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "product_image",
      "label": "Plant Image"
    }
    
    The uploaded image should be displayed dynamically.
    
    Also provide an optional image picker for:
    - Background/decorative plant image
    - Optional promotional image
    
    Do NOT use the human image from the reference.
    
    7. HOVER EFFECT
    
    When the user hovers over a product card:
    - Slightly lift the card.
    - Add a subtle shadow.
    - Plant image should have a very subtle zoom effect.
    - Add-to-cart button can slightly scale.
    - Keep the animation smooth and premium.
    - Do not make the animation excessive.
    
    8. ADD TO CART
    
    The circular shopping-bag/cart button should work with Shopify's cart functionality.
    
    If the block is connected to a Shopify product:
    - Clicking the button should add the selected product to cart.
    - Use Shopify's product/variant information.
    - If necessary, provide a product selector in the Theme Editor.
    
    Provide:
    - Product selector
    - Variant support
    - Add-to-cart functionality
    
    9. RESPONSIVE DESIGN
    
    Desktop:
    - 3 product cards visible.
    - Cards should have equal width.
    - Carousel occupies approximately 65–70% of the section.
    - Leave enough breathing space around the cards.
    
    Mobile:
    - One card visible at a time.
    - Horizontal swipe carousel.
    - Product cards should remain visually large.
    - Hide unnecessary decorative elements.
    - Keep prices and buttons easy to tap.
    - No horizontal page overflow.
    
    10. CODE REQUIREMENTS
    
    Generate a complete Shopify Online Store 2.0 section.
    
    Provide:
    - Liquid
    - HTML
    - CSS
    - JavaScript
    - Shopify schema
    with middle of the this section i need "view all products" button
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding }}px 24px;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
  }
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    right: -120px;
    top: 50%;
    width: 420px;
    height: 420px;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    border-radius: 50%;
    pointer-events: none;
    opacity: .24;
    background: repeating-conic-gradient(from 0deg, transparent 0deg 9deg, {{ block.settings.accent_color }} 9deg 10deg);
    mask-image: radial-gradient(circle, transparent 0 36%, #000 37% 64%, transparent 65%);
  }
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner { max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__header { display: flex; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; margin-bottom: 28px; }
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading { color: {{ block.settings.text_color }}; font: inherit; font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 42px); line-height: 1.1; margin: 0; }
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__subheading { color: {{ block.settings.muted_color }}; margin: 8px 0 0; }
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__view-all { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 46px; padding: 0 22px; border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.primary_color }}; border-radius: 999px; color: {{ block.settings.primary_color }}; font-weight: 650; text-decoration: none; white-space: nowrap; transition: background .2s ease, color .2s ease; }
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__view-all:hover { background: {{ block.settings.primary_color }}; color: #fff; }
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__viewport { overflow: hidden; }
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track { display: flex; gap: 20px; overflow-x: auto; scroll-snap-type: x mandatory; scroll-behavior: smooth; scrollbar-width: none; padding: 4px 3px 18px; }
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card { flex: 0 0 calc((100% - 40px) / 3); min-width: 0; scroll-snap-align: start; overflow: hidden; border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_radius }}px; background: {{ block.settings.card_color }}; box-shadow: 0 4px 18px rgba(24, 54, 33, .07); transition: transform .25s ease, box-shadow .25s ease; }
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(24, 54, 33, .14); }
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media { height: 260px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; background: #f1eee6; }
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media img { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; transition: transform .45s ease; }
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card:hover .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media img { transform: scale(1.035); }
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder { width: 100%; height: 100%; display: grid; place-items: center; position: relative; }
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; }
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty { position: absolute; bottom: 10px; left: 8px; right: 8px; text-align: center; color: #536157; font-size: 12px; }
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badges { position: absolute; left: 12px; right: 12px; top: 12px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; align-items: start; }
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge { border-radius: 999px; padding: 6px 10px; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: 700; }
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge--best { background: {{ block.settings.primary_color }}; color: #fff; }
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge--discount { margin-left: auto; background: {{ block.settings.accent_color }}; color: #14231a; }
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__info { padding: 16px 17px 18px; position: relative; min-height: 177px; }
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__rating { display: inline-flex; gap: 5px; align-items: center; border-radius: 999px; padding: 4px 8px; background: #f1f5e9; color: {{ block.settings.primary_color }}; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 650; }
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title { font: inherit; font-family: Georgia, serif; color: {{ block.settings.text_color }}; font-size: 20px; margin: 9px 45px 4px 0; line-height: 1.2; }
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__description { margin: 0 40px 12px 0; color: {{ block.settings.muted_color }}; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.45; }
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__prices { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: baseline; flex-wrap: wrap; padding-right: 42px; }
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price { color: {{ block.settings.primary_color }}; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 750; }
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__compare { color: {{ block.settings.muted_color }}; font-size: 13px; text-decoration: line-through; }
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__add { position: absolute; right: 16px; bottom: 16px; width: 42px; height: 42px; display: grid; place-items: center; padding: 0; border: 0; border-radius: 50%; background: {{ block.settings.primary_color }}; color: #fff; cursor: pointer; transition: transform .2s ease, background .2s ease; }
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__add:hover { background: {{ block.settings.dark_color }}; transform: scale(1.06); }
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__add:focus-visible, .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow:focus-visible, .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__view-all:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid {{ block.settings.accent_color }}; outline-offset: 3px; }
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__add svg { width: 19px; height: 19px; }
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__nav { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; margin-top: 5px; }
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow { width: 42px; height: 42px; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: 50%; background: {{ block.settings.primary_color }}; color: #fff; border: 0; cursor: pointer; }
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow--prev { opacity: .7; }
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow:disabled { opacity: .35; cursor: not-allowed; }
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__status { margin: 10px 0 0; text-align: center; color: {{ block.settings.muted_color }}; font-size: 13px; }
  @media (max-width: 989px) { .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card { flex-basis: calc((100% - 20px) / 2); } .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media { height: 240px; } }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} { padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding | divided_by: 2 }}px 16px; } .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}::after { display: none; } .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__header { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; gap: 15px; } .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card { flex-basis: 82%; } .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media { height: 245px; } .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track { gap: 14px; margin-right: -16px; padding-right: 16px; } .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title { font-size: 19px; } }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track { scroll-behavior: auto; } .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card, .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media img, .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__add { transition: none; } }
{% endstyle %}

<nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}" style="width: {{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner">
    <div class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__header">
      <div>
        {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}<h2 class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading">{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.subheading != blank %}<p class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__subheading">{{ block.settings.subheading | escape }}</p>{% endif %}
      </div>
      {% if block.settings.view_all_url != blank %}<a class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__view-all" href="{{ block.settings.view_all_url }}">{{ block.settings.view_all_label | escape }}</a>{% endif %}
    </div>
    <div class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__viewport">
      <div class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track" data-track>
        {% for i in (1..6) %}
          {% assign product_key = 'product_' | append: i %}
          {% assign image_key = 'image_' | append: i %}
          {% assign title_key = 'title_' | append: i %}
          {% assign description_key = 'description_' | append: i %}
          {% assign price_key = 'price_' | append: i %}
          {% assign compare_key = 'compare_price_' | append: i %}
          {% assign discount_key = 'discount_' | append: i %}
          {% assign bestseller_key = 'bestseller_' | append: i %}
          {% assign bestseller_text_key = 'bestseller_text_' | append: i %}
          {% assign rating_key = 'rating_' | append: i %}
          {% assign reviews_key = 'reviews_' | append: i %}
          {% assign link_key = 'link_' | append: i %}
          {% assign image = block.settings[image_key] %}
          {% assign product = block.settings[product_key] %}
          {% assign title = block.settings[title_key] %}
          {% assign description = block.settings[description_key] %}
          {% assign current_price = block.settings[price_key] %}
          {% assign compare_price = block.settings[compare_key] %}
          {% assign link = block.settings[link_key] %}
          {% if product != blank %}
            {% assign title = product.title %}
            {% assign description = product.description | strip_html | truncate: 80 %}
            {% assign current_price = product.price | money %}
            {% assign compare_price = product.compare_at_price | money %}
            {% assign link = product.url %}
          {% endif %}
          {% if image != blank or product != blank or title != blank %}
            <article class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card">
              <div class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media">
                {% if image != blank %}<img src="{{ image | image_url: width: 900 }}" alt="{{ image.alt | default: title | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ image.width }}" height="{{ image.height }}">
                {% elsif product.featured_image %}<img src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 900 }}" alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | default: product.title | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ product.featured_image.width }}" height="{{ product.featured_image.height }}">
                {% else %}<div class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder">{{ 'product-apparel-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}<span class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty">Add a plant image in the block settings</span></div>{% endif %}
                <div class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badges">
                  {% if block.settings[bestseller_key] %}<span class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge--best">{{ block.settings[bestseller_text_key] | escape }}</span>{% endif %}
                  {% if block.settings[discount_key] != blank %}<span class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge--discount">{{ block.settings[discount_key] | escape }}</span>{% endif %}
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__info">
                <span class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__rating"><span aria-hidden="true">★</span> {{ block.settings[rating_key] | escape }} <span aria-hidden="true">|</span> {{ block.settings[reviews_key] | escape }}</span>
                <h3 class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title">{% if link != blank %}<a href="{{ link }}">{{ title | escape }}</a>{% else %}{{ title | escape }}{% endif %}</h3>
                {% if description != blank %}<p class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__description">{{ description | escape }}</p>{% endif %}
                <div class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__prices"><span class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price">{{ current_price | escape }}</span>{% if compare_price != blank %}<span class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__compare">{{ compare_price | escape }}</span>{% endif %}</div>
                {% if product != blank and product.available %}
                  {% assign selected_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant %}
                  <form method="post" action="/cart/add" class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart-form">
                    <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ selected_variant.id }}"><input type="hidden" name="quantity" value="1"><input type="hidden" name="return_to" value="/cart">
                    <button class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__add" type="submit" aria-label="Add {{ product.title | escape }} to cart"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 8h14l1 12H4L5 8Z"></path><path d="M9 8a3 3 0 0 1 6 0"></path></svg></button>
                  </form>
                {% elsif link != blank %}<a class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__add" href="{{ link }}" aria-label="View {{ title | escape }}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 8h14l1 12H4L5 8Z"></path><path d="M9 8a3 3 0 0 1 6 0"></path></svg></a>{% endif %}
              </div>
            </article>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__nav"><button class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow--prev" type="button" data-prev aria-label="Previous products"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span></button><button class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow" type="button" data-next aria-label="Next products"><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button></div>
    <p class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__status" data-status aria-live="polite"></p>
  </div>
</nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (() => {
    const tagName = 'nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}';
    if (customElements.get(tagName)) return;
    class NurseryCarousel extends HTMLElement {
      connectedCallback() {
        this.track = this.querySelector('[data-track]');
        this.prev = this.querySelector('[data-prev]');
        this.next = this.querySelector('[data-next]');
        this.status = this.querySelector('[data-status]');
        if (!this.track || !this.prev || !this.next) return;
        this.prev.addEventListener('click', () => this.move(-1));
        this.next.addEventListener('click', () => this.move(1));
        this.track.addEventListener('scroll', () => this.update(), { passive: true });
        this.resizeObserver = new ResizeObserver(() => this.update());
        this.resizeObserver.observe(this.track);
        this.update();
      }
      disconnectedCallback() { if (this.resizeObserver) this.resizeObserver.disconnect(); }
      move(direction) {
        const card = this.track.querySelector('article');
        if (!card) return;
        const gap = parseFloat(getComputedStyle(this.track).gap) || 0;
        this.track.scrollBy({ left: direction * (card.getBoundingClientRect().width + gap), behavior: 'smooth' });
      }
      update() {
        const max = this.track.scrollWidth - this.track.clientWidth;
        this.prev.disabled = this.track.scrollLeft <= 2;
        this.next.disabled = this.track.scrollLeft >= max - 2;
        if (this.status) this.status.textContent = this.track.children.length ? 'Swipe or use the arrows to explore plants' : '';
      }
    }
    customElements.define(tagName, NurseryCarousel);
  })();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Plant product carousel",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Handpicked favourites" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "subheading", "label": "Subheading", "default": "Bring a little more green into your home." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "view_all_label", "label": "View all label", "default": "View all products" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "view_all_url", "label": "View all link" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "desktop_width_percent", "label": "Desktop width", "min": 50, "max": 100, "step": 5, "unit": "%", "default": 100 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "section_padding", "label": "Section padding", "min": 20, "max": 80, "step": 5, "unit": "px", "default": 45 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "card_radius", "label": "Card corner radius", "min": 0, "max": 30, "step": 2, "unit": "px", "default": 16 },
    { "type": "color", "id": "background_color", "label": "Section background", "default": "#FFF9E8" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "card_color", "label": "Card background", "default": "#FFFFFF" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "primary_color", "label": "Primary green", "default": "#1F5130" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "dark_color", "label": "Dark green", "default": "#0D3A1D" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "accent_color", "label": "Accent", "default": "#FFD60A" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "text_color", "label": "Text", "default": "#14231A" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "muted_color", "label": "Muted text", "default": "#5B6660" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Plant card 1" },
    { "type": "product", "id": "product_1", "label": "Shopify product" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image_1", "label": "Plant image" },
